<section class="aero-section aero-section--tight">
  <div class="page-width">
    <div class="aero-glass aero-window" style="max-width:960px;margin-inline:auto;">
      <div class="aero-window__bar">
        <span class="aero-window__dots" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="aero-window__dot aero-window__dot--cyan"></span>
          <span class="aero-window__dot aero-window__dot--green"></span>
          <span class="aero-window__dot aero-window__dot--pink"></span>
        </span>
      </div>

      <div style="padding:clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 3rem);">
        <h1>{{ section.settings.heading | default: page.title | escape }}</h1>

        <div style="font-size:1.06rem;line-height:1.7;color:var(--aero-ink-muted);">
          {%- if page.content != blank -%}
            {{ page.content }}
          {%- else -%}
            <p>Welcome to Terpscoops, part of the Terpmetrix family, where precision meets style in every scoop. What started as a happy accident—one broken 3D print—turned into the perfect solution for those who love cannabis but hate the mess.</p>
            <p>I'm Sam, the creator of Terpscoops, and like you, I wanted a cleaner, smarter way to handle my weed. Terpscoops offer an alternative—a sleek, ergonomic tool designed to sit right inside your grinder so it's always handy.</p>
            <p>No sticky fingers, no bits under your nails, just an intentional design hand-packed in a classic dime bag with love in Boulder, CO.</p>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Origin Story Page",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Override Page Heading",
      "default": "From One Broken 3D Print in Boulder to Your Daily Ritual."
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Origin Story Page"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}

